1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,247
Because the industry was already scoring her against it.

2
00:00:03,247 --> 00:00:10,824
Idol survival culture in Korea runs on comparison — vocal tone versus tone, screen time versus screen time.

3
00:00:10,824 --> 00:00:17,177
For every comment celebrating her range, there was a spreadsheet measuring her against BLACKPINK's timeline.

4
00:00:17,177 --> 00:00:21,005
The nickname had given her a head start and a debt at the same time.

5
00:00:21,005 --> 00:00:26,211
Her response, over the next twenty-four months, was to make the spreadsheets irrelevant.

